              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akageuka, akamwambia Petro, Nenda nyuma yangu, Shetani; u kikwazo kwangu; maana huyawazi yaliyo ya Mungu, bali ya wanadamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
